"pengstem", "name": {"en-US": "百度网盘 Go"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Community patchwork build of the Baidu Netdisk client, with automatic encrypted backup."}, "description": {"en-US": "The BaiduNetGo Android client of the community patchwork build of pengstem's\nBaidu Netdisk (百度网盘 Go) — a Material 3 Expressive app that pairs with the\npure-Go desktop client published on the same repository.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Sign in by scanning a QR code (or paste Cookie / BDUSS+STOKEN).\n- Browse the netdisk with list/grid views, sorting, search and file details.\n- Folder backup: pick local folders (SAF) and mirror them into a netdisk\n  folder incrementally on a schedule (manual / 15 min / 1 h / 6 h / 24 h) in\n  the background with WorkManager, or immediately with live progress.\n- Album backup: pick MediaStore albums and back their photos and videos up.\n- Encrypted backup: OpenPGP symmetric encryption turns every uploaded file\n  into a .gpg that `gpg -d` opens on any computer — the same format the\n  desktop client writes, so files from both devices restore alike.\n- Transfers with progress, speed and cancel.\n- Account and quota info, upload concurrency, Wi-Fi-only mode and themes.\n\nBuilt from upstream plus the patch queue in this repository; the desktop\nhalf is released separately (it is not an F-Droid package).\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.pengstem.baidunetgo/en-US/icon_sD26zDSgaobZAjUq7iTQmjIU91DtRp887Z0vGN1RJAY=.png", "sha256": "b03dbacc34a06a86d902352aee24d09a3214f750ed469f3ced9d2f18dd512406", "size": 45376}}, "preferredSigner": "d33488794065c92e370d24a10e614e1e64e319b75e6f8bb7c4aad67f3a5b5e01"}, "versions": {"6f47da8099e931c9c05cf81d6770e0eefc7603fad1ffd827ecc7136d8724cb0b": {"added": 1795582409000, "file": {"name": "/BaiduNetGo-0.8.3-patchwork.apk", "sha256": "6f47da8099e931c9c05cf81d6770e0eefc7603fad1ffd827ecc7136d8724cb0b", "size": 18545392}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "0.8.3-patchwork", "version